WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.315
NOTICE. A child tells an adult about an itchy patch.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.931
CARE. The child uses a clean personal towel.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.613
LEARN. Ringworm is fungal; eczema is not contagious.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.223
HELP. A health professional checks an unclear rash.
